r\", V(5208, 16, 737),\010            \"When a cell opens: ground floor of the main building, 4 levers; the correct combination CHANGES, so do not trust a fixed order. Remotes: Pull, Release. Then kill the Awakened Warden.\", {} },\010        { \"Colosseum\", \"Colosseum Fight\", \"Sea1/Colosseum/King's Apprentice\", \"Colosseum Emperor\", V(-1847, 91, -3334),\010            \"Talk to the Colosseum Emperor -> enter the red circle and win 3 waves -> Emperor again -> Colosseum Quest Giver. Remotes: StartMatch, State.\", {} },\010        { \"Colosseum\", \"The Champion's Statues\", \"Sea1/Colosseum/Legendary Creator Statues\", \"Colosseum Quest Giver\", V(-1342, 11, -2929),\010            \"4 stone statues near the quest giver: hit each with its own type - sword statue = Sword, fruit statue = Fruit, fist statue = Melee, gun statue = Gun - until all change position.\", {} },\010        { \"Colosseum\", \"The Crowd Favorite\", \"Sea1/Colosseum/Crowd Favorite\", \"Colosseum Quest Giver\", V(-1342, 11, -2929),\010            \"On the 'crowd wants a show' message: grey targets appear on the arena walls - hit ALL of them with a GUN within 90 seconds -> Colosseum Quest Giver.\", {} },\010        { \"Magma Village\", \"The Magma Geyser\", \"Sea1/Magma Village/Evil Slimes\", \"The Mayor\", V(-5309, 17, 8483),\010            \"Small magma pond near the docks: kill the small elementals the geyser spits, destroy the geyser, kill the Magma Elemental -> Mayor.\", {} },\010        { \"Magma Village\", \"Magma Drilling\", \"Sea1/Magma Village/Magma Ore Extraction\", \"The Mayor\", V(-5309, 17, 8483),\010            \"On the drilling message: mine at the back of the island, take the elevator (the cave is a separate area ~ -61200,6823,9000) -> avoid the Prospectors' light beams -> destroy the Magma Drill -> elevator out -> Mayor.\", {} },\010        { \"Magma Village\", \"Awakened Magma General\", \"Sea1/Magma Village/One Last Eruption\", \"The Mayor\", V(-5309, 17, 8483),\010          